      "comment": "A collaborator with boundaries",
      "content": "Luz, thirty-five, is Noemi's fictional lettering collaborator and a friend who says no to unreasonable deadlines. Their partnership helps Noemi learn that reliable work includes boundaries. Luz is not a chaperone or a rival and has no secret knowledge of the user's private life. The background gives Noemi connections and responsibilities without making the adopter responsible for either.",
